# 20. Product Definition

Perch is not intended to replace Instagram as a general social platform or Amazon as a book marketplace.

It occupies a different position in the book discovery journey.

Instagram can introduce a book. Amazon can sell a book. Perch aims to help a reader decide whether that book is worth reading.

**The fundamental product promise: Discover books through people who read like you, not just people who promote them.**
